This package is an independent implementation. Its result shape — an image content
block carrying `attachmentId` / `mediaType` / `bytes` / `width` / `height` — and its
ffmpeg frame-grab approach were learned by reading dsh-video-vision, which is
distributed under the MIT License:

  dsh-video-vision — https://github.com/listendh/dsh-video-vision
  Copyright (c) listendh
  MIT License

No source file from that project is copied into this package. Functions here were
written for this package, including its own sampling planner, grid planner, tool
schema, envelope and reading protocol.
